            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A coupling device (10A, 10B) for connecting a first shaft (100) and a second shaft (102), comprising: an inner ring member (40) mounted on the first shaft (100); an outer ring member (42) mounted on the second shaft (102), the outer ring member (42) being disposed on an outer circumferential side of the inner ring member (40); an elastic member (44) for connecting the inner ring member (40) and the outer ring member (42); an inner elastic body (46) mounted on an inner circumferential side of the inner ring member (40); and an additional weight (48) detachably supported by the inner elastic body (46) on an inner circumferential side of the inner elastic body (46), wherein the outer ring member (42) is connected to a one surface of a coupling plate (50) by a bolt, another surface (50) of the coupling plate being connected to the second shaft (102).</p>
            </abstract>
